{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Zerg Survivor: Endless Siege&quot; is a light roguelike bullet-hell shooter set in deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No need to move, no need to collect XP\u2014just focus on building your skills and tearing through waves of enemies with overwhelming firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you survive 30 waves, the game enters Endless Mode: no more manual control, just upgrade and survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806490/extras/7c9ed879933964f3c4238fbd71a28a4c.poster.avif?t=1754123544\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806490/extras/7c9ed879933964f3c4238fbd71a28a4c.webm?t=1754123544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806490/extras/7c9ed879933964f3c4238fbd71a28a4c.mp4?t=1754123544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddec Core Gameplay Highlights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 Minimal Controls, Maximum Mayhem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No movement, no pickup grinding\u2014just pure skill builds and explosive action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 Rapid Builds, Instant Fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simplified progression lets you complete your build fast and dive right into the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806490/extras/3b58a7d788181b67288b897190b4258a.poster.avif?t=1754123544\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806490/extras/3b58a7d788181b67288b897190b4258a.webm?t=1754123544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806490/extras/3b58a7d788181b67288b897190b4258a.mp4?t=1754123544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 Bullet Heaven Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless waves, insane amounts of bullets and skills flying across the screen\u2014all with smooth performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 Powerful Talent Upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and enhance passive talents to push your survival even further in Endless Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806490/extras/f06b15d5a70dc87fae18643d24b878a8.poster.avif?t=1754123544\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806490/extras/f06b15d5a70dc87fae18643d24b878a8.webm?t=1754123544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806490/extras/f06b15d5a70dc87fae18643d24b878a8.mp4?t=1754123544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 Random Event System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rare in-game events add excitement and unpredictability to every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 Global Leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the ranks and see how your survival stacks up against players worldwide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The enemies are endless - how many waves can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806490/extras/db93b42f6799adf2caad1173160eb0d9.poster.avif?t=1754123544\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806490/extras/db93b42f6799adf2caad1173160eb0d9.webm?t=1754123544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806490/extras/db93b42f6799adf2caad1173160eb0d9.mp4?t=1754123544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Max Laser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806490/2559e50b11afa1b0bb100898090d9d8ee398051d.jpg"},{"name":"Max Pulse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806490/0d1df635236ae92ab57e7b03d4954d6c86df572a.jpg"},{"name":"Max Spore Core","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806490/883d8264e309eab55691c2213e84d049ef755f52.jpg"},{"name":"Max Grenade ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806490/ee1a167547452ac77e5044b032382b5e0b745b53.jpg"},{"name":"Max Meteor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806490/da2a88beec2dcabaaa985b6c7124f942dadbb645.jpg"},{"name":"Story Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806490/a99514338587d7f17608cf200a41c342c09e0604.jpg"},{"name":"First Run Done","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806490/17cf63acb3e40206ebd5eb7e0876abef06cf5424.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806490?t=1754123544","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806490/d873088bf69afb414c133e8c206c467f70a778a1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754123544","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806490/f89a5ab64d5cbe2a49aaf58e96d2724b09cb26cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754123544","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806490/f89a5ab64d5cbe2a49aaf58e96d2724b09cb26cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754123544","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descriptio